        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "问题背景"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "问题背景"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "docker 进程使用 Unix Socket（/var/run/docker.sock）而不是 TCP 端口。默认情况下该 Unix socket 属于 root 用户，因此普通用户需要 root 权限才能访问，直接执行 docker 命令会报权限不足。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "解决方案：将用户加入 docker 组"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "解决方案将用户加入-docker-组"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "sudo groupadd docker          # 添加 docker 用户组（若不存在）\nsudo gpasswd -a $XXX docker   # 将指定用户加入 docker 组（XXX 为用户名）\nsudo gpasswd -a $USER docker  # 将当前用户加入 docker 组\nnewgrp docker                 # 刷新当前会话的组信息（重新登录亦可）"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "命令说明"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "命令说明"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "align": [
          null,
          null
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "groupadd docker"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "创建 docker 用户组（多数发行版安装 docker 后已自动创建，可跳过）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "gpasswd -a 用户 docker"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "把用户追加（add）到 docker 组"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "newgrp docker"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "使组变更立即生效，无需重新登录"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "验证"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "验证"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "# 重新登录（或 newgrp）后执行\ndocker ps\n# 无权限报错即成功"
      },
      {
