                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "安全提醒：docker 组等同于 root 权限（组内用户可挂载宿主机目录、以特权模式运行容器），仅对可信用户授权（补充）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "若 docker 命令本身不存在，先安装：yum install -y docker 或 apt install -y docker.io（补充）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "某些系统还需重启 docker 服务：systemctl restart docker（补充）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
